{
  "_comment": [
    "Channel layouts for tools/fixtures-from-paramsets.js.",
    "A paramset description dump only knows channel *types*, never channel indexes.",
    "",
    "'channels' is the real layout of the device, entry n being channel n, read from a",
    "listDevices dump of the hardware. The entries that have one were measured on the",
    "Homematic Manager lab CCUs (firmware 3.89.8) on 2026-09-05, roadmap task 6.",
    "",
    "Without 'channels', the layout is synthesised from 'order' (the channel types after",
    "MAINTENANCE, which is always channel 0) and 'counts' (how many of each). That is",
    "consistent within a fixture (CHILDREN, PARENT and INDEX always agree) but not",
    "guaranteed to match the real device. Device types without an entry get one channel",
    "per channel type, in the order they appear in the dump."
  ],
